    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2025/5/29 Patch 1.0.2, which adjusts the increase in acquired experience and fixes other problems, is now available.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2025/5/29 Patch 1.0.1, which fixes the forced termination bug, has been distributed.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bAll characters involved in sexual content are over the age of 18.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bThere are no R18 elements in this work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\uff1cAbout\uff1e</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an action game where you will defeat the stage by collecting Crysnuts that are on</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the map without bumping into any enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will radiant Fighters Ikuno Hinata and Anami Tsukine be able to destroy the ambitions of the evil empress Hamester!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\uff1cStory\uff1e</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Ikuno Hinata&quot; and &quot;Anami Tsukine&quot; are ordinary female college students!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, they met the Crysnut Fairies, &quot;Sen&quot; and &quot;Rizu&quot; who plan to restore world peace,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and get asked to protect the world from the evil empress Hamester!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It seems as though Ikuno and Anami have the potential to become Radiant Fighters and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fight against evil, but... Hamester attacks the city and things get dicey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After deciding to protect all that's important and fight...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They transform into Radiant Fighters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To protect world peace and each other, the two rise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But Hamester becomes more powerful with the Crysnuts...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will happen to world peace!? Fight for what's right, Ikuno, Anami!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\uff1cSystem\uff1e</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0Retrieve the Crysnuts!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain all Crysnuts scattered throughout the map whilst avoiding the Hameham,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hamester's underlings to clear the stage. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the map are items, such as &quot;Nut soda&quot; that heals your health, and &quot;Hamster wheel&quot; that will make you invincible against the Hamehams. Use these to conquer the stage! But watch out for traps that slow you down and stop your movement!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0Stuff the cheeks with Crysnuts to increase volume!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collected Crysnuts will make &quot;Sen&quot; and &quot;Rizu&quot;'s cheeks puff up who are attached to their chests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more Crysnuts that you collect, the biggest &quot;Sen&quot; and &quot;Rizu&quot;'s cheeks will get!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't get it mixed up...! Their chests aren't getting bigger, their cheeks are just puffing up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0Crysnut Fairies can be slapped onto butts too!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By meeting certain conditions, the Crysnut Fairies, &quot;Sen&quot; and &quot;Zuri&quot; can move from the chest to the butt and forme change. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When they're on the chest they'll give you more maximum health,but when they're on the butt they'll increase speed by decreasing maximum health!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the forme change based on the situation and take on the stage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Of course, even attached to the butt, &quot;Sen&quot; and &quot;Zuri&quot;'s cheeks will expand by collecting more Crysnuts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\uff1cCHARACTER\uff1e</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbIkuno Hinata  (Voice:Akiho Suzumoto\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbAnami Tsukine  (Voice:Saho Shirasu\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbSen  (Voice:Saima nakano\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbRizu (Voice:Sachie Hirai\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbHamester  (Voice:Rika Kinugawa\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\uff1cSTAFF\uff1e</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbCharacter Design:Waon Inui</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbScenario:Linkedbrain Inc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbProducer:Yujiro Usuda</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2025/5/29 Patch 1.0.2, which adjusts the increase in acquired experience and fixes other problems, is now available.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2025/5/29 Patch 1.0.1, which fixes the forced termination bug, has been distributed.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bAll characters involved in sexual content are over the age of 18.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bThere are no R18 elements in this work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\uff1cAbout\uff1e</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an action game where you will defeat the stage by collecting Crysnuts that are on</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the map without bumping into any enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will radiant Fighters Ikuno Hinata and Anami Tsukine be able to destroy the ambitions of the evil empress Hamester!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\uff1cStory\uff1e</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Ikuno Hinata&quot; and &quot;Anami Tsukine&quot; are ordinary female college students!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, they met the Crysnut Fairies, &quot;Sen&quot; and &quot;Rizu&quot; who plan to restore world peace,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and get asked to protect the world from the evil empress Hamester!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It seems as though Ikuno and Anami have the potential to become Radiant Fighters and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fight against evil, but... Hamester attacks the city and things get dicey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After deciding to protect all that's important and fight...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They transform into Radiant Fighters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To protect world peace and each other, the two rise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But Hamester becomes more powerful with the Crysnuts...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will happen to world peace!? Fight for what's right, Ikuno, Anami!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\uff1cSystem\uff1e</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0Retrieve the Crysnuts!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain all Crysnuts scattered throughout the map whilst avoiding the Hameham,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hamester's underlings to clear the stage. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the map are items, such as &quot;Nut soda&quot; that heals your health, and &quot;Hamster wheel&quot; that will make you invincible against the Hamehams. Use these to conquer the stage! But watch out for traps that slow you down and stop your movement!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0Stuff the cheeks with Crysnuts to increase volume!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collected Crysnuts will make &quot;Sen&quot; and &quot;Rizu&quot;'s cheeks puff up who are attached to their chests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more Crysnuts that you collect, the biggest &quot;Sen&quot; and &quot;Rizu&quot;'s cheeks will get!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't get it mixed up...! Their chests aren't getting bigger, their cheeks are just puffing up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0Crysnut Fairies can be slapped onto butts too!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By meeting certain conditions, the Crysnut Fairies, &quot;Sen&quot; and &quot;Zuri&quot; can move from the chest to the butt and forme change. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When they're on the chest they'll give you more maximum health,but when they're on the butt they'll increase speed by decreasing maximum health!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the forme change based on the situation and take on the stage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Of course, even attached to the butt, &quot;Sen&quot; and &quot;Zuri&quot;'s cheeks will expand by collecting more Crysnuts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\uff1cCHARACTER\uff1e</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbIkuno Hinata  (Voice:Akiho Suzumoto\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbAnami Tsukine  (Voice:Saho Shirasu\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbSen  (Voice:Saima nakano\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbRizu (Voice:Sachie Hirai\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbHamester  (Voice:Rika Kinugawa\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\uff1cSTAFF\uff1e</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbCharacter Design:Waon Inui</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbScenario:Linkedbrain Inc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbProducer:Yujiro Usuda</p>",
